WEBVTT

00:07:59.468 --> 00:08:02.249
we weren't talking about obesity.

00:08:02.249 --> 00:08:07.260
And so, on New Year's Eve of 2007,

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.299
I went to the zoo,

00:08:09.299 --> 00:08:11.720
and I stood in front of the elephants,

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.583
and I said, "This city is going on a diet,

00:08:15.583 --> 00:08:19.202
and we're going to lose a million pounds."

00:08:19.202 --> 00:08:20.975
Well, that's when all hell broke loose.

00:08:20.975 --> 00:08:23.753
(Laughter)

00:08:23.753 --> 00:08:25.636
The national media

00:08:25.636 --> 00:08:30.153
gravitated toward this story immediately,